    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Generate SEO audit reports from a web form with GPT-5 mini and Gmail\n\n## How it works\n1. A visitor submits their landing page URL and email in a hosted n8n form.\n2. The workflow fetches the raw HTML of the page and extracts the readable content (title, meta description, headings, body text).\n3. Two AI chains run on the same page: a technical on-page audit on the HTML source, and a content and keyword audit on the extracted text.\n4. Both audits are combined into a single HTML report and emailed to the visitor with Gmail.\n5. Every request is logged as a lead in Google Sheets (date, URL, email), turning the audit into a lead magnet.\n\n",
        "height": 476,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
